{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub087_middle_f_01",
      "hash": "69183b2fbfcbb2c9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小呆呆獸你真是的。\\n真傷腦筋啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub087_middle_f_02",
      "hash": "6918382fbfcbadb0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哎呀，是說……\\n方便的話，\\r\\n可以請[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳幫我一個忙嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub087_middle_f_03",
      "hash": "6918392fbfcbaf63",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳應該很忙吧。\\n對不起喔……"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub087_middle_f_04",
      "hash": "69183e2fbfcbb7e2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我接下來打算去\\n深灰博物館。\\c\\n可是小呆呆獸\\n怎麼也不肯動呢。"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub087_yadon_01",
      "hash": "f0f118be8033672a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆呆獸「呆喔～"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub087_middle_f_05",
      "hash": "69183f2fbfcbb995",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "方便的話，可以請[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳暫時\\n幫我照顧一下小呆呆獸嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub087_middle_f_09",
      "hash": "6918432fbfcbc061",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "哎呀！我說，方便的話，\\n可以請[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳再幫我\\r\\n照顧一下小呆呆獸嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub087_select_01",
      "hash": "087a940740025655",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好啊"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub087_select_02",
      "hash": "087a91074002513c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "對不起"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub087_middle_f_06",
      "hash": "69183c2fbfcbb47c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "謝謝幫忙！\\n那麼，小呆呆獸就暫時\\r\\n拜託[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳照顧了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub087_yadon_02",
      "hash": "f0f117be80336577",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "………………\\n………………"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_01",
      "hash": "a2604769f3459b22",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆呆獸\\n呆呆地注視著前方……"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_02",
      "hash": "a2604669f345996f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆呆獸一直\\n無所事事……"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_03",
      "hash": "a2604569f34597bc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆呆獸就站在那裡。\\n看起來好像很舒服的樣子……"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_04",
      "hash": "a2604469f3459609",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆呆獸看起來\\n好像在想事情……"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_05",
      "hash": "a2604369f3459456",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆呆獸似乎第一次\\n注意到了[VAR TRNAME(0000)]的存在……"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_06",
      "hash": "a2604269f34592a3",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆呆獸\\n瞄了[VAR TRNAME(0000)]一眼……"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_07",
      "hash": "a2604169f34590f0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆呆獸有點在意\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]……"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_08",
      "hash": "a2605069f345aa6d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆呆獸似乎開始習慣\\n[VAR TRNAME(0000)]了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_09",
      "hash": "a2604f69f345a8ba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "呆呆獸看起來\\n好像很高興……"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_10",
      "hash": "a25cc269f342834c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "能和[VAR TRNAME(0000)]一起，\\n呆呆獸看起來挺高興的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_11",
      "hash": "a25cc369f34284ff",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……和呆呆獸一起\\n度過了一段悠閒的時光！"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_sub087_middle_f_07",
      "hash": "69183d2fbfcbb62f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "謝謝[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳\\n幫我照顧小呆呆獸！\\c\\n這是我的一點心意，\\n能請[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳收下嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_sub087_system_12",
      "hash": "a25cc469f34286b2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從阿姨那裡\\n得到了[VAR ITEM2(0001)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "id": "msg_sub087_middle_f_08",
      "hash": "6918422fbfcbbeae",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "方便的話，\\n下次再拜託[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳囉。"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_087_max",
      "hash": "48df59edae2527ff"
    }
  ]
}
